REM ghost_typer.duck [FUNNY/SPOOKY] - types slowly like a hesitant ghost.
REM Harmless text only. Open Notepad first (or focus a text field).
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1800
STRING is
DELAY 600
STRING  anyone
DELAY 600
STRING  there
DELAY 600
STRINGLN ?
DELAY 1500
STRINGLN ...hello?
DELAY 1200
STRINGLN (it's just a keyboard. boo.)
